font-heading font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-navy-300"><span>Cardano Blockchain</span> - <!-- -->
        April
        22, 
        2026</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-1 flex-col justify-end"><h4 class="t-24 font-heading font-bold text-navy-400 line-clamp-3 dark:text-navy-200" style="transform:none">Yoroi Wallet Is Evolving Into SecondFi: What You Need to Know</h4></div></div></div></a><a href="/press-news/emurgo-unveils-secondfi-the-self-custodial-neofinance-platform-bridging-everyday-spending-with-onchain-yield/"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="relative aspect-[378/192] overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] bg-navy-100 dark:bg-navy-500"><img alt="EMURGO Introduces SecondFi" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover object-center" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Femurgo.wpengine.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FPress-Release-Cover-6.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="flex flex-col pt-8 md:aspect-[379/190]"><p class="t-15 font-heading font-medium leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-navy-300"><span>Cardano Blockchain</span> - <!-- -->
        April
